I'm new at NetHacking, but I've been playing patiently, reading this
newsgroup, and finally have a decent 15th level Barbarian. However,
I'm still left with some questions, so here goes:

1) I understand cockatrices can turn you to stone. I've encountered
three of these critters, all of which successfully attacked me for
at least two rounds before I dispatched them. No stoning or even
hint of stoning. Was I just lucky, or what? Should I get rid of those
lizard corpses I'm carrying around to guard against cockatrice attacks?

2) I also understand you can wield cockatrice corpses and stone monsters.
So how does one accomplish this? I'm wearing leather gloves and have
tried wielding, throwing, and applying the corpse to no avail. BTW,
I'm playing Nethack 3.1.1 on a Mac and the menu selections don't seem
to be complete for all the possible actions a character can take. 
Wielding, throwing, and applying never list the cockatrice corpse as
one of the objects of the action.

3) I found a magic portal in a Bigroom on Dlvl 12, which sent me to a
level labeled Home 1 having a throne with some honcho sitting on it.
From the instructions I received, I gathered I had reached the start
of the Barbarian quest. However, the only direction I could go was down,
only for three levels, and there was nothing special about any of the
levels, just easily dispatched trolls and ogres. Did I miss something?
Are the Home levels the same as the Quest levels? I don't think so, but
I've never gotten this far before. From other spoilers I've read, I
thought the Quest levels went up (i.e., you started at the bottom).

4) How do you level teleport? I've got teleport and teleport control and
can pretty much jump around within a level (unless some mysterious force
stops me). Is it a spell, something you get with more experience, or
what?

